; CML-shaped dependency exercising plain-group export: a record-member plain group
; (protocol_version), three group-choice-variant plain groups with fixed tags (stake_registration,
; stake_delegation, host), an `; @name`-renamed field (pool -> pool_thing), an optional field
; (? port), and a nested group ref (the tag-groups reference `credential`). The dep references all of
; them so they materialize as Records and travel as transparent group-body rows in its export.
; Consumed by tests/extern-import/consumer-groups/lib.cddl.
credential = bytes
protocol_version = (major: uint, minor: uint)
stake_registration = (tag: 0, credential)
stake_delegation = (tag: 2, credential, pool: bytes) ; @name pool_thing
host = (tag: 4, ? port: uint)
dep_holder = [pv: protocol_version, c: dep_cert]
dep_cert = [ stake_registration // stake_delegation // host ]
